Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 03:02:47 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat: fairy rings (dial, travel log, Zanaris and
 Last-destination)

New module on the cache's fairyring dbtable: Configure (Dramen or Lunar staff) opens the dial
(398) with the travel log (381); dial buttons and 'Use code' set fairyring_1..3; Confirm,
Zanaris and Last-destination teleport (fairyring_lastloc_opvis drives the op text); the log
lists visited codes (server varps). A code with no ring, or the ring you stand in, does not
move you (OSRS Wiki). Favourites, the hideout sequence and per-ring requirements are not done.

On teleport the travel log's mobile search input (meslayer mode 28, opened by the client) is closed with meslayer_close: meslayer_ondialogabort does not cover mode 28.
